{"type": "result", "session_id": "20261005_133336_bdf14e", "exit_code": 0, "text": "Reviewed post_adf85fbf5c9b4c6cb38de642281955fa against the saved design table and report. Its methodological limits were already incorporated in LABBOOK and the published analysis.\n\nDonor/lot pairing and matched parental clones remain undocumented—not proven absent. Positional windows remain sensitivity sets, not transcript assignments; the separate experiments cannot identify a cAMP-by-SOX10 interaction.\n\nNo change to the findings or next step: relative P1-associated RNA loss after SOX10 knockout is descriptively robust, whereas preferential cAMP induction is fragile. No reanalysis or follow-up question is needed.", "tokens": {"input": 43855, "output": 901, "total": 317140, "cache_read": 272384, "cache_write": 0}, "duration_ms": 265214, "timestamp": 1791236062409}
